---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
interface Props { heading?: boolean }
const { heading = true } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="reveal">
  {heading && <SectionHead eyebrow="Showreel 2026" title="65 seconds on how I work" sub="Five real systems, a few more I built, and what clients say. It plays silently and pauses when you scroll away." />}
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface aspect-video" data-reel>
    <video class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/video/george-reel-poster.webp" aria-label="George Melody showreel, 65 seconds, no audio">
      <source src="/video/george-reel.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      Your browser can't play this video. <a href="/video/george-reel.mp4">Download it</a>.
    </video>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent">
      <p class="font-display text-lg text-white">Ideas, turned into <em>systems.</em></p>
      <button type="button" class="reel-toggle grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-black" aria-label="Pause video">
        <svg class="i-pause" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 5h4v14H6zM14 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg>
        <svg class="i-play hidden" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[3px] bg-white/20"><div class="reel-bar h-full w-0 bg-white"></div></div>
  </div>
  <details class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer text-link">Read the video as text</summary>
    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
      <p>I build AI automation that runs your business while you sleep.</p>
      <p>One form creates 200 pieces of content in 5 to 10 minutes (n8n, GPT-4o, Notion).</p>
      <p>A ChatGPT that queries 130 properties through 7 tools (n8n, Supabase, MCP).</p>
      <p>Every sales call is scored against a ten-section guide (Claude, Make).</p>
      <p>Every point-of-sale sale is deducted from stock every 15 minutes (n8n, Postgres, Toast).</p>
      <p>A missed call becomes a booked appointment (n8n, Twilio, Airtable).</p>
      <p>Also built, 24+ systems: a RAG agent that stays in sync with Google Drive, a talking-avatar video creator from daily news, UGC ad videos generated on autopilot, and a clip pipeline from raw video to a Notion review queue.</p>
      <p>Client reviews: 5.0 stars on Upwork. Crafted by George, Top Rated on Upwork. Need AI automation like this? Message me now.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-reel]').forEach((box) => {
    const v = box.querySelector('video')!;
    const btn = box.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.reel-toggle')!;
    const bar = box.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.reel-bar')!;
    const pauseIcon = btn.querySelector('.i-pause')!, playIcon = btn.querySelector('.i-play')!;
    const reduce = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    let userPaused = reduce, visible = false;
    const sync = () => {
      pauseIcon.classList.toggle('hidden', v.paused);
      playIcon.classList.toggle('hidden', !v.paused);
      btn.setAttribute('aria-label', v.paused ? 'Play video' : 'Pause video');
    };
    const tryPlay = () => { if (!userPaused && visible) v.play().catch(() => {}); };
    new IntersectionObserver(([e]) => {
      visible = e.isIntersecting;
      if (visible) { if (v.preload !== 'auto') v.preload = 'auto'; tryPlay(); } else v.pause();
    }, { threshold: 0.35 }).observe(box);
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => { userPaused = !v.paused; v.paused ? v.play().catch(() => {}) : v.pause(); });
    v.addEventListener('play', sync); v.addEventListener('pause', sync);
    v.addEventListener('timeupdate', () => { bar.style.width = (v.currentTime / (v.duration || 1)) * 100 + '%'; });
    sync();
  });
</script>
